[3.450305, "o", "\u001b[1;34m• Explaining\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.451134, "o", "  \u001b[35m✦ llm:explore.explain\u001b[0m \u001b[2mreplay 0ms\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.452557, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.456249, "o", "Tasks are created by \u001b[1;36;40mPOST /tasks\u001b[0m → \u001b[1;36;40mcreate_task()\u001b[0m in \u001b[1;36;40mroutes/tasks.py:15\u001b[0m:                                       \r\n\r\n\u001b[36m 1 \u001b[0mParses the JSON body with \u001b[1;36;40mrequest.get_json(silent=True) or {}\u001b[0m (\u001b[1;36;40mroutes/tasks.py:17\u001b[0m), so a missing/invalid   \r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0mbody becomes \u001b[1;36;40m{}\u001b[0m.                                                                                           \r\n\u001b[36m 2 \u001b[0mReads \u001b[1;36;40mtitle\u001b[0m with a default of \u001b[1;36;40m\"\"\u001b[0m (\u001b[1;36;40mroutes/tasks.py:18\u001b[0m) — \u001b[1mno validation\u001b[0m, so an empty or whitespace-only title\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0mis accepted.                                                                                               \r\n\u001b[36m 3 \u001b[0mCalls \u001b[1;36;40mTaskStore.add_task()\u001b[0m (\u001b[1;36;40mmodels.py:44\u001b[0m), which assigns the next id from an \u001b[1;36;40mitertools.count\u001b[0m, builds a \u001b[1;36;40mTask\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m   \u001b[0mwith status \u001b[1;36;40m\"todo\"\u001b[0m and a UTC \u001b[1;36;40mcreated_at\u001b[0m, and stores it in a dict.                                          \r\n\u001b[36m 4 \u001b[0mReturns the task as JSON with \u001b[1m201 Created\u001b[0m (\u001b[1;36;40mroutes/tasks.py:24\u001b[0m).                                            \r\n\r\nThe store is injected via \u001b[1;36;40mapp.config[\"STORE\"]\u001b[0m in \u001b[1;36;40mcreate_app()\u001b[0m (\u001b[1;36;40mmain.py:12\u001b[0m), which is how tests get a fresh    \r\nstore per test.                                                                                               \r\n"]
[3.456821, "o", "\u001b[2m── explore · success · route: rules · 4 tool calls (+1 cached) · 1 llm calls · 0.04s\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
