[10.006614, "o", "✅ Fix the off-by-one in paginate(): pages are 1-indexed, so the slice must start at (page - 1) * per_page.   \r\nThe test is correct; the helper was skipping the first page.                                                  \r\n\r\n\u001b[40m                                                                                                              \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\u001b[91;40m--- a/utils/helpers.py\u001b[0m\u001b[40m                                                                                      \u001b[0m\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\u001b[92;40m+++ b/utils/helpers.py\u001b[0m\u001b[40m                                                                                      \u001b[0m\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\u001b[37;40m@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@\u001b[0m\u001b[40m                                                                                           \u001b[0m\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\u001b[97;40m \u001b[0m\u001b[40m                                                                                                           \u001b[0m\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\u001b[97;40m \u001b[0m\u001b[97;40mdef paginate(items: list, page: int, per_page: int) -> list:\u001b[0m\u001b[40m                                               \u001b[0m\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\u001b[97;40m \u001b[0m\u001b[97;40m    \"\"\"Return the slice of ``items`` for a 1-indexed ``page``.\"\"\"\u001b[0m\u001b[40m                                          \u001b[0m\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\u001b[91;40m-    start = page * per_page\u001b[0m\u001b[40m                                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\u001b[92;40m+    start = (max(page, 1) - 1) * per_page\u001b[0m\u001b[40m                                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\u001b[97;40m \u001b[0m\u001b[97;40m    return items[start:start + per_page]\u001b[0m\u001b[40m                                                                   \u001b[0m\u001b[40m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[40m                                                                                                              \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mVerified:\u001b[0m lint clean · tests: 5 passed, 0 failed                                                              \r\n\r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0msay \u001b[1mundo\u001b[0m to revert (transaction \u001b[1;36;40m4fefaa\u001b[0m)                                                                    \r\n"]
